---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import TopNav from '../components/TopNav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Book a Call — Alexandria"
  description="Install Raven with a founder at your elbow. 45 minutes, live onboarding."
>
  <TopNav slot="nav" />
  <main class="container support-page">
    <h1>Install Raven together</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">
      <em
        >45 minutes. One of us on the call with you. You run Raven's elicitation, we watch. You get
        live support, we learn what's breaking on real machines.</em
      >
    </p>

    <section class="support-section">
      <h2>What the call is for</h2>
      <div class="value-exchange">
        <div class="value-side">
          <h3>You</h3>
          <p>
            You get past the rough edges of a cold install. You ask the questions you'd otherwise
            have to email about. You end the call with a foundational library in place and a sense
            of how Raven fits into your actual workflow.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-side">
          <h3>Us</h3>
          <p>
            We watch how you answer Raven's elicitation questions, which is the single
            highest-signal thing we can do at this stage. Every call teaches us something the repo
            issues don't.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="support-section">
      <h2>What to bring</h2>
      <ul class="bring-list">
        <li>
          <strong>Your codebase</strong> (or at least access to it).
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Any product docs you've got</strong>, however scattered. Notion, a README, a
          Google Doc, a whiteboard photo. Raven works with what you have.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>A working Claude subscription.</strong> Max if you're planning to ship code alongside
          the library; Pro is fine if you're just setting up the library for now.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>A sense of what you're trying to build.</strong> Not a pitch deck. Just enough that
          we can calibrate the elicitation to your actual project.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="support-section">
      <h2>What you'll walk away with</h2>
      <div class="walkaway-grid">
        <div class="walkaway-item">
          <p>A working installation of Raven, pointed at your real codebase.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="walkaway-item">
          <p>
            The foundational tier of your library populated. Brand voice, product scope, the
            decisions you've already made.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="walkaway-item">
          <p>
            A direct line to both of us for the next 30 days. You can email or Slack when something
            breaks or when you want to go deeper into the valuable and nice-to-have tiers.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="walkaway-item">
          <p>
            Design partner status. That means free, rough edges, and a seat in the room as
            Alexandria evolves.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="support-section book-section">
      <h2>Book it</h2>

      <div class="email-callout">
        <p>
          Drop us a line and we'll find some time:
          <a href="mailto:team@sociotechnica.org">team@sociotechnica.org</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="intake-question">
        <p>One question we'll ask before the call:</p>
        <blockquote>
          <p>
            <em
              >In one sentence: what's the project or team situation where Alexandria would most
              move the needle for you right now?</em
            >
          </p>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .support-page {
    padding-top: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .support-page h1 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .page-intro {
    color: var(--color-cream-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .support-section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(232, 228, 220, 0.06);
  }

  .support-section:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .support-section h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .support-section p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .value-exchange {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .value-side {
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid rgba(232, 228, 220, 0.06);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .value-side h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .value-side p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .bring-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .bring-list li {
    padding: 1rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(232, 228, 220, 0.06);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-cream-muted);
  }

  .bring-list li:first-child {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(232, 228, 220, 0.06);
  }

  .bring-list strong {
    color: var(--color-cream);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .walkaway-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .walkaway-item {
    background: rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.12);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .walkaway-item p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .email-callout {
    background: rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.2);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .email-callout p {
    color: var(--color-cream);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .email-callout a {
    color: var(--color-amber);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .email-callout a:hover {
    color: var(--color-amber-glow);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .intake-question {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .intake-question blockquote {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-amber);
    background: rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.04);
    border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
  }

  .intake-question blockquote p {
    color: var(--color-cream);
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .value-exchange {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .walkaway-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
